    "tpb_book": "<div>一、企業內部控制導論與應用(三版)<br />\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E5%BC%B5%E6%8C%AF%E5%B1%B1/adv_author/1/\">張振山</a></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;出版社：<a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/web/sys_puballb/books/?pubid=security\">證期會</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;出版日期：2023/06/01<br />\n二、鑑識會計與舞弊防治<br />\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;作者：許順雄<br />\n　　出版版：滄海書書<br />\n　　出版日期：2021/10</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
